In common with many other projects (and following the changed default
branch name at github) we have renamed the master branch in the latex3
and latex2e repositories to "main".

If you have a local clone of the latex3 or latex2e repositories please exec=
ute

git branch -m master main
git fetch origin
git branch -u origin/main main
git remote set-head origin main

in each repository to rename your local branch to main
and to re-establish the tracking of the project repository main branch.

Announcing here for these two core repositories but the master
branches in related repositories such as hyperref, iftex have been
renamed already and the remaining ones will be done in due course.

David

